            <p>
                Please note the details below for your convenience and necessary action to ensure a smooth exchange of cheques:
            </p>
            
            
            <p>
           <br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>1. Resident Customers:</b></br>
               We are currently holding your post-dated cheque based on the previous milestone date. Kindly book an appointment with us by sending an email to <a href="mailto:collections@modon.com">collections@modon.com</a> to arrange for the replacement of the cheque in line with the revised dates, no later than 10 June 2026.
            </p>
            
            <p>
           <br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>2. Non-Resident Customers:</b> </br>
                We kindly request that the due payment be transferred on or before the revised milestone date to the bank account details provided below.
            </p>
            
            
            <table>
                      <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><b>Account Name:</b></td> 
                                <td>{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.Name}</td>
                        </tr>
                        
                          <tr>
                            <td><b>Account Number:</b></td> 
                                <td>{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.VirtualAccountNumber__c}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><b>IBAN Number:</b></td> 
                                <td>{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.VirtualIBANNumber__c}</td>                            
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Currency:</b></td> 
                                <td>AED</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Bank Name: </b></td> 
                            
                                <td>{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.EscrowAccount__r.BankName__c} </td>
                            
                            
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Swift Code:</b></td> 

                                <td>{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.EscrowAccount__r.SwiftCode__c}<!--{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.EscrowAccount__r.SwiftCode__c}--></td>
                           
                           
                            
                        </tr>
                      </tbody>
                  </table>
            
            
            <p>
                To confirm your payment and ensure accuracy, kindly reply to <a href="mailto:collections@modon.com">collections@modon.com</a> with the receipt (proof of payment) or transaction reference number once the payment has been processed.
            </p>

            <p>
                Your prompt attention to this matter is highly appreciated to ensure timely processing and avoid any delays.
            </p>
            
            <p>
               <b> Note : If you have already made the payment or replaced the cheques, we thank you and ask that you kindly disregard this email.</b>
            </p>
            
            <p>
                For more information and immediate assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us on 800-MODON (66366) or visit our Customer Management on the 20th floor of Al Maryah Tower.<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maryah+Tower/@24.49841,54.3906064,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5e67acdf150f29:0x5f4ca7797b069048!8m2!3d24.49841!4d54.3906064!16s%2Fg%2F11f03pn0pd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDQxNC4xIKXMDSoJLDEwMjExNDUzSAFQAw%3D%3D">Click here for location</a>.
            </p>
            <b>
            <p>
            Warm Regards,
            </p>
            <p>
            Modon Customer Management 
            </p>
            <p>
            800-MODON (66366) 
            </p>
            </b>
            
        </body>
    </html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>